# Materi riset thesis (PDF besar, draft, notebook Colab) — bukan bagian app,
# jangan masuk git (bisa ratusan MB). Selective tracking: 8 artefak metodologis
# episode-ontology dipilih visible eksplisit di bawah (lihat
# CORPUS_DIPLOMATICUM_RECOVERY_PREFLIGHT.md, fase apply-patch) — SEMUA isi lain
# docs/thesis/ (CSV korpus, PDF, notebook, XML, model output, dsb.) tetap ignored.
docs/thesis/*
!docs/thesis/EPISODE_ONTOLOGY_ANNOTATION_PROTOCOL_DRAFT.md
!docs/thesis/pilot_annotation/
docs/thesis/pilot_annotation/*
!docs/thesis/pilot_annotation/EPISODE_ANNOTATION_TEMPLATE.md
!docs/thesis/pilot_annotation/BARUS_EPISODE_DOSSIER_DRAFT.md
!docs/thesis/pilot_annotation/INDERAPURA_EPISODE_DOSSIER_DRAFT.md
!docs/thesis/pilot_annotation/PARIAMAN_EPISODE_DOSSIER_DRAFT.md
!docs/thesis/pilot_annotation/KOTO_TANGAH_EPISODE_DOSSIER_DRAFT.md
!docs/thesis/pilot_annotation/PILOT_CLAIM_LEDGER.md
!docs/thesis/pilot_annotation/ARCHIVAL_DENSITY_MEASUREMENT_PLAN.md

# Scan Dagh-register sumber primer (puluhan MB/volume) — dipakai sekali utk
# sisir manual, ekstraksi hasilnya ada di data/research/*.csv + migrasi DB,
# jadi PDF mentah tak perlu ikut git history
docs/*.pdf

# Claude Code — state lokal per-mesin, bukan konfigurasi proyek yg dibagikan
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# SEC-SNK-1: cegah raw text_asli 552MB / artefak besar masuk git
# Riset korpus tema — raw dump JANGAN pernah commit (ratusan MB, ada text_asli mentah).
# Slim CSV reproducible (~3.5M) TETAP di-commit; seed research bergantung padanya.
data/research/raw/
data/research/*_raw.csv
data/**/*.raw
*.raw
*text_asli*
!data/research/korpus_tema_slim.csv

# Staging pemulihan Corpus Diplomaticum (CD1-6.pdf) dari Google Drive eksternal
# peneliti (lihat CORPUS_DIPLOMATICUM_RECOVERY_PREFLIGHT.md) -- PDF/archive/OCR/
# hasil ekstraksi sementara TIDAK BOLEH masuk git, sama alasan docs/*.pdf di atas.
# Direktori belum dibuat sesi ini; rule ditambah lebih dulu supaya aman begitu
# dipakai. Tanpa pengecualian manifest -- manifest kelak di lokasi tracked terpisah.
data/archive_sources/corpus_diplomaticum/

# Sumber gambar 404 (3MB) — pakai jpg teroptimasi di static
Designer404.png

# Artefak Windows lighthouse nyasar (batas WSL/Windows)
C:*

# data/export/ -- output kerja Colab (cache LLM besar, CSV kandidat review manual)
# diunduh manual dari Drive, bukan sumber kebenaran repo (itu data/research/) --
# jangan commit, cek data/research/linimasa_events.csv setelah merge manual selesai
data/export/

# SALIDO-HDT solver run output -- hasil skenario CP-SAT, bukan input kanonik
docs/enclave/implementation/solver_runs/
*.egg-info/

# SALIDO-HDT solver -- generated runtime output, never canonical input
.env.*
outputs/salido_hdt/
tmp/
temp/
scenario_*.json
scenario_*.csv
validation_summary.json
run_metadata.json
docs/enclave/scans/
~$*.docx
